<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 878 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 878 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 878 contracts compared with 200 overnight Thursday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 81 wheat, 508 corn, 190 soybean, 95 soymeal and four soyoil contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1-1/2 to 3 lower, corn was 1/2 to 2 lower and soybeans were 1/2 higher to 2-1/2 cents per bushel lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
